### LINUX ###

1.first make sure you have gcc installed and then satisfied the build dependacies for your distrubution.

Ubuntu
sudo apt install -y libsdl2-dev libsdl2-gfx-dev libpng-dev libvorbis-dev libvpx-dev

Fedora
sudo dnf install -y SDL2-devel SDL2_gfx-devel libpng-devel libvorbis-devel libvpx-devel

2.open a terminal in the engine directory and run:

# for 64bit executable.
./build.sh 4 amd64

# for 32bit executable.
./build.sh 4 x86